# ACT TWO · WARNING
@0:39-0:45 img:market ken:left cue:tense,0.6
vo: But hear what He said about the little ones.
@0:45-0:51 img:kneel ken:in
audio: ../assets/audio/home-build-1.mp3 gain -2db until 1:10.7 fade 0.3
vo: "Whoever causes one of these little ones to stumble..."
ref: Matthew 18:6
@0:51-0:57 img:millstone ken:down
vo: "...better for them to have a millstone hung around their neck,
vo: and to be drowned in the depths of the sea."
@0:57-1:01 img:crowd ken:drift
text: We love people.
text: We protect them.
@1:01-1:05 black hold:silent
@1:05-1:11 img:door ken:push cue:tense,0.7
vo: "Not everyone who says to me, 'Lord, Lord'...
vo: I never knew you."
ref: Matthew 7:21–23
@1:11-1:13 drop:"The truth will set you free" ref:"John 8:32"
sfx: ../assets/audio/home-punch-1.mp3 gain -4db

